  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reinforcing Disaster Preparedness and Early Emergency Response in Haiti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Due to its geographical position, Haiti is highly exposed to natural disasters. Haiti is classified as the most vulnerable in the Caribbean region and the 14th most vulnerable country in the world. The objective of this joint UNICEF/IOM Action is to strengthen disaster preparedness and early response in Haiti and more specifically in areas vulnerable to natural-disasters, water-borne disease outbreaks, conflicts and resulting high-level of displacements.</narrative>
  </description>
